          "text": "Description: A witness reports by phone observing during the night of June 27, 2009, between 11:55 and midnight, the passage of approximately fifty orange glowing orbs. Other witnesses in his building reportedly made the same observation. Although the description of observing a large number of orange glowing orbs suggests flying lanterns, an investigation is impossible due to a lack of additional information (no completed questionnaire or police report) despite follow-ups with the witness.",
